{"seq":3,"slug":"simulation-timing-analysis","title":"仿真与时序分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-development-flow/simulation-timing-analysis","wordCount":1644,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"仿真与时序分析\">仿真与时序分析</h1><p>仿真和时序分析是验证 FPGA 设计正确性的两大核心手段。仿真验证逻辑功能是否符合预期（&quot;做的对不对&quot;），时序分析验证电路在目标频率下能否稳定工作（&quot;跑得快不快&quot;）。本文系统介绍功能仿真、时序仿真和静态时序分析（STA）的原理与实践方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>验证 FPGA 设计需要回答两个互相独立的问题：<strong>功能对不对</strong>与<strong>时序够不够</strong>。前者靠仿真，用激励驱动设计并观察输出；后者靠静态时序分析，不施加激励而是穷举所有时序路径的延迟。二者不可相互替代——功能仿真通过并不能保证时序收敛，时序满足也不代表逻辑正确。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>仿真按抽象层级划分</strong>：功能仿真（RTL、无延迟）最快，综合后仿真验证推断结果，时序仿真（网表 + SDF）最慢但含真实延迟。</li>\n<li><strong>STA 的基石是建立/保持时间</strong>：建立时间限制最高频率，保持时间与频率无关、由最短路径决定；两者统一量化为 Slack。</li>\n<li><strong>Slack 是唯一的时序判据</strong>：Slack &gt; 0 满足，= 0 临界，&lt; 0 违例；WNS/TNS 概括整份报告的严重程度。</li>\n<li><strong>优化有次序</strong>：先看逻辑级数，再看扇出与布线延迟，最后才考虑时钟树与硬核内部流水线。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"仿真分类与定位\">仿真分类与定位</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 验证层次&#10;        FS[&quot;功能仿真&lt;br/&gt;RTL Simulation&quot;] --&gt; GS[&quot;门级仿真&lt;br/&gt;Gate-level Sim&quot;]&#10;        GS --&gt; TS[&quot;时序仿真&lt;br/&gt;Timing Simulation&quot;]&#10;        TS --&gt; HW[&quot;硬件验证&lt;br/&gt;Board Testing&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 抽象层级&#10;        H[&quot;高抽象&lt;br/&gt;快速&quot;] -.-&gt; FS&#10;        L[&quot;低抽象&lt;br/&gt;精确&quot;] -.-&gt; TS&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 验证层次\n        FS[\"功能仿真&lt;br/&gt;RTL Simulation\"] --&gt; GS[\"门级仿真&lt;br/&gt;Gate-level Sim\"]\n        GS --&gt; TS[\"时序仿真&lt;br/&gt;Timing Simulation\"]\n        TS --&gt; HW[\"硬件验证&lt;br/&gt;Board Testing\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 抽象层级\n        H[\"高抽象&lt;br/&gt;快速\"] -.-&gt; FS\n        L[\"低抽象&lt;br/&gt;精确\"] -.-&gt; TS\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>仿真类型</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>考虑延迟</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>发现的问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>功能仿真（前仿）</td>\n<td>RTL 源码</td>\n<td>不考虑</td>\n<td>最快</td>\n<td>逻辑功能错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>综合后仿真</td>\n<td>网表</td>\n<td>不考虑</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>综合推断错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时序仿真（后仿）</td>\n<td>网表 + SDF</td>\n<td>真实延迟</td>\n<td>最慢</td>\n<td>时序违例、毛刺</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"功能仿真\">功能仿真</h2><h3 id=\"testbench-基本结构\">Testbench 基本结构</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"verilog\" data-code=\"`timescale 1ns / 1ps&#10;&#10;module tb_counter;&#10;&#10;// 信号声明&#10;reg         clk;&#10;reg         rst;&#10;wire [7:0]  count;&#10;wire        overflow;&#10;&#10;// 被测模块例化&#10;counter_8bit uut (&#10;    .clk      (clk),&#10;    .rst      (rst),&#10;    .count    (count),&#10;    .overflow (overflow)&#10;);&#10;&#10;// 时钟生成：100 MHz&#10;initial clk = 0;&#10;always #5 clk = ~clk;  // 周期 10 ns&#10;&#10;// 激励序列&#10;initial begin&#10;    rst = 1;&#10;    #100;           // 复位保持 100 ns&#10;    rst = 0;&#10;    #3000;          // 运行 3000 ns&#10;    $finish;&#10;end&#10;&#10;// 结果检查&#10;always @(posedge clk) begin&#10;    if (!rst &amp;&amp; count === 8&#39;hFF &amp;&amp; !overflow)&#10;        $display(&quot;ERROR: overflow not asserted at count=0xFF, time=%0t&quot;, $time);&#10;end&#10;&#10;// 波形导出&#10;initial begin&#10;    $dumpfile(&quot;counter.vcd&quot;);&#10;    $dumpvars(0, tb_counter);&#10;end&#10;&#10;endmodule\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>`timescale 1ns / 1ps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module tb_counter;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 信号声明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>reg         clk;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>reg         rst;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wire [7:0]  count;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wire        overflow;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 被测模块例化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>counter_8bit uut (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .clk      (clk),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .rst      (rst),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .count    (count),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .overflow (overflow)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 时钟生成：100 MHz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>initial clk = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>always #5 clk = ~clk;  // 周期 10 ns</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 激励序列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>initial begin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    rst = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #100;           // 复位保持 100 ns</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    rst = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #3000;          // 运行 3000 ns</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    $finish;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 结果检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>always @(posedge clk) begin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (!rst &#x26;&#x26; count === 8'hFF &#x26;&#x26; !overflow)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        $display(\"ERROR: overflow not asserted at count=0xFF, time=%0t\", $time);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 波形导出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>initial begin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    $dumpfile(\"counter.vcd\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    $dumpvars(0, tb_counter);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>endmodule</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"自检测-testbench\">自检测 Testbench</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>验证方式</th>\n<th>实现方法</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>人工观察波形</td>\n<td><code>$dumpfile</code> + GTKWave/VCS GUI</td>\n<td>直观但低效，不可回归</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>断言检查</td>\n<td><code>assert</code> / <code>$error</code></td>\n<td>自动检测违规条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参考模型对比</td>\n<td>Golden model + 逐拍比较</td>\n<td>全面验证功能正确性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖率驱动</td>\n<td>代码覆盖 + 功能覆盖</td>\n<td>量化验证完备度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"常用仿真器\">常用仿真器</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>仿真器</th>\n<th>厂商</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Vivado Simulator (xsim)</td>\n<td>AMD/Xilinx</td>\n<td>免费，与 Vivado 集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ModelSim/QuestaSim</td>\n<td>Siemens EDA</td>\n<td>业界标准，性能优秀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VCS</td>\n<td>Synopsys</td>\n<td>最快的商业仿真器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Icarus Verilog</td>\n<td>开源</td>\n<td>免费，适合学习和小型项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Verilator</td>\n<td>开源</td>\n<td>将 RTL 编译为 C++，速度极快</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"静态时序分析-sta\">静态时序分析（STA）</h2><h3 id=\"sta-基本原理\">STA 基本原理</h3><p>STA 不需要测试激励，而是通过穷举所有时序路径来验证设计是否满足时序约束。它基于以下概念：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 时序路径&#10;        FF1[&quot;源触发器&lt;br/&gt;Launch FF&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;组合逻辑延迟&lt;br/&gt;Data Path&quot;| FF2[&quot;目标触发器&lt;br/&gt;Capture FF&quot;]&#10;        CLK[&quot;时钟源&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;时钟路径延迟&quot;| FF1&#10;        CLK --&gt;|&quot;时钟路径延迟&quot;| FF2&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 时序路径\n        FF1[\"源触发器&lt;br/&gt;Launch FF\"] --&gt;|\"组合逻辑延迟&lt;br/&gt;Data Path\"| FF2[\"目标触发器&lt;br/&gt;Capture FF\"]\n        CLK[\"时钟源\"] --&gt;|\"时钟路径延迟\"| FF1\n        CLK --&gt;|\"时钟路径延迟\"| FF2\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"建立时间与保持时间\">建立时间与保持时间</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>约束含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>建立时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{su}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>数据必须在时钟有效沿之前稳定的最小时间</td>\n<td>限制最高工作频率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保持时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>数据必须在时钟有效沿之后继续保持的最小时间</td>\n<td>与频率无关，由最短路径决定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>建立时间检查</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{clk} &gt; T_{cq} + T_{logic} + T_{routing} + T_{su} - T_{skew}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=