2em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li>Slack &gt; 0：满足时序</li>\n<li>Slack = 0：临界</li>\n<li>Slack &lt; 0：时序违例</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"时序报告解读\">时序报告解读</h3><p>典型时序报告中的关键信息：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>理想值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>WNS（Worst Negative Slack）</td>\n<td>所有路径中最差的建立时间裕量</td>\n<td>&gt; 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TNS（Total Negative Slack）</td>\n<td>所有违例路径 slack 之和</td>\n<td>= 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WHS（Worst Hold Slack）</td>\n<td>最差保持时间裕量</td>\n<td>&gt; 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>THS（Total Hold Slack）</td>\n<td>所有保持违例之和</td>\n<td>= 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WPWS（Worst Pulse Width Slack）</td>\n<td>最差脉冲宽度裕量</td>\n<td>&gt; 0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"关键路径分析\">关键路径分析</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tcl\" data-code=\"# 查看最差的 10 条建立时间路径&#10;report_timing -max_paths 10 -sort_by slack&#10;&#10;# 查看特定模块的路径&#10;report_timing -from [get_cells datapath/*] -to [get_cells output_reg/*]&#10;&#10;# 查看跨时钟域路径&#10;report_timing -from [get_clocks clk_fast] -to [get_clocks clk_slow]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 查看最差的 10 条建立时间路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>report_timing -max_paths 10 -sort_by slack</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 查看特定模块的路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>report_timing -from [get_cells datapath/*] -to [get_cells output_reg/*]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 查看跨时钟域路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>report_timing -from [get_clocks clk_fast] -to [get_clocks clk_slow]</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"时序优化策略\">时序优化策略</h2><p>当 STA 报告时序违例时，按以下流程排查和优化：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>违例原因</th>\n<th>诊断方法</th>\n<th>优化手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>组合逻辑级数过深</td>\n<td><code>report_timing</code> 查看逻辑层级</td>\n<td>插入流水线寄存器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高扇出信号</td>\n<td><code>report_high_fanout_nets</code></td>\n<td>寄存器复制（register duplication）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>布线延迟过大</td>\n<td>路径报告中 routing &gt; 60%</td>\n<td>添加物理约束（Pblock）或 floorplan</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时钟偏差</td>\n<td><code>report_clock_skew</code></td>\n<td>优化时钟树或使用区域时钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DSP/BRAM 路径</td>\n<td>穿越硬核 IP 的路径</td>\n<td>开启硬核内部流水线寄存器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"寄存器重定时-retiming\">寄存器重定时（Retiming）</h3><p>寄存器重定时是综合工具自动将触发器在组合逻辑前后移动以均衡路径延迟的优化技术：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 重定时前&#10;        A1[&quot;FF&quot;] --&gt; L1[&quot;长逻辑&lt;br/&gt;5 ns&quot;] --&gt; B1[&quot;FF&quot;] --&gt; L2[&quot;短逻辑&lt;br/&gt;1 ns&quot;] --&gt; C1[&quot;FF&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 重定时后&#10;        A2[&quot;FF&quot;] --&gt; L3[&quot;均衡逻辑&lt;br/&gt;3 ns&quot;] --&gt; B2[&quot;FF&quot;] --&gt; L4[&quot;均衡逻辑&lt;br/&gt;3 ns&quot;] --&gt; C2[&quot;FF&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 重定时前\n        A1[\"FF\"] --&gt; L1[\"长逻辑&lt;br/&gt;5 ns\"] --&gt; B1[\"FF\"] --&gt; L2[\"短逻辑&lt;br/&gt;1 ns\"] --&gt; C1[\"FF\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 重定时后\n        A2[\"FF\"] --&gt; L3[\"均衡逻辑&lt;br/&gt;3 ns\"] --&gt; B2[\"FF\"] --&gt; L4[\"均衡逻辑&lt;br/&gt;3 ns\"] --&gt; C2[\"FF\"]\n    end</pre><p>重定时在 Vivado 中通过 <code>synth_design -retiming</code> 选项启用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"仿真与-sta-的互补关系\">仿真与 STA 的互补关系</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>功能仿真</th>\n<th>静态时序分析</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>验证内容</td>\n<td>逻辑正确性</td>\n<td>时序正确性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否需要激励</td>\n<td>需要（testbench）</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖率</td>\n<td>取决于测试用例</td>\n<td>穷举所有路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时间</td>\n<td>与仿真时长成正比</td>\n<td>固定（与设计规模相关）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发现问题类型</td>\n<td>功能 bug</td>\n<td>时序违例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用阶段</td>\n<td>全流程</td>\n<td>综合/实现后</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>完整的验证策略应当两者结合：先通过功能仿真确保逻辑正确，再通过 STA 确保在目标频率下可靠工作。对于关键路径，时序仿真（后仿）可以提供带有真实延迟的波形级验证，确认 STA 报告的违例是否真正影响功能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>仿真验证逻辑功能，静态时序分析验证时序正确性，二者互补而非替代。</li>\n<li>仿真按抽象层级分功能仿真、综合后仿真和时序仿真，越接近硬件越精确但越慢。</li>\n<li>自检测 testbench 用断言、参考模型对比或覆盖率驱动替代人工看波形，才能用于回归验证。</li>\n<li>STA 无需激励、穷举所有路径，核心是建立时间（限制最高频率）与保持时间（与频率无关，由最短路径决定）。</li>\n<li>时序裕量 Slack = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{clk} - (T_{cq} + T_{logic} + T_{routing} + T_{su} - T_{skew})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，Slack &gt; 0 满足，&lt; 0 违例；WNS/TNS/WHS 概括整体情况。</li>\n<li>优化按诊断结果对症下药：逻辑级数深插流水线，高扇出做寄存器复制，布线延迟大加物理约束，硬核路径开启内部流水线。</li>\n<li>寄存器重定时自动在组合逻辑前后移动触发器以均衡路径延迟，Vivado 中通过 <code>-retiming</code> 启用。</li>\n<li>完整验证策略是先功能仿真确保逻辑正确，再 STA 确保目标频率下可靠工作。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"仿真与时序分析","id":"仿真与时序分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"仿真分类与定位","id":"仿真分类与定位"},{"level":2,"text":"功能仿真","id":"功能仿真"},{"level":3,"text":"Testbench 基本结构","id":"testbench-基本结构"},{"level":3,"text":"自检测 Testbench","id":"自检测-testbench"},{"level":3,"text":"常用仿真器","id":"常用仿真器"},{"level":2,"text":"静态时序分析（STA）","id":"静态时序分析-sta"},{"level":3,"text":"STA 基本原理","id":"sta-基本原理"},{"level":3,"text":"建立时间与保持时间","id":"建立时间与保持时间"},{"level":3,"text":"时序报告解读","id":"时序报告解读"},{"level":3,"text":"关键路径分析","id":"关键路径分析"},{"level":2,"text":"时序优化策略","id":"时序优化策略"},{"level":3,"text":"寄存器重定时（Retiming）","id":"寄存器重定时-retiming"},{"level":2,"text":"仿真与 STA 的互补关系","id":"仿真与-sta-的互补关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"约束文件编写","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-development-flow/constraint-files"},"next":{"title":"数字信号处理加速","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-applications/dsp-acceleration"}}